-- MasterMounts: rare spawn points, extracted from HandyNotes.
-- `poolRares` lists EVERY rare that can drop the mount -- RareAlert already
-- read this field but nothing populated it, so a mount dropping from five
-- rares only ever alerted on one. `spawns` keeps every point, because a
-- rare that patrols or spawns in several places is the normal case and
-- collapsing it to the first is how a player ends up at the wrong end of a
-- zone. The router does not yet choose the nearest of these.
local _, MM = ...

